OL,3,GNEWSAFather admits causing death of
OL,4,Ason, 6, in car crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe father of a six-year-old boy who
OL,7,Fdied in a car crash in County
OL,8,FLondonderry has pleaded guilty to
OL,9,Fcausing his son's death by dangerous
OL,10,Fdriving.
OL,12,FEthan McCourt died almost a week after
OL,13,Fhe was injured following the crash on
OL,14,Froads between the Magherafelt bypass
OL,15,Fand the Castledawson Roundabout on 20
OL,16,FJune 2022.
OL,18,FAt Londonderry Crown Court on Thursday
OL,19,Fhis father Declan McCourt, 47, of
OL,20,FBardahessiagh Road in Pomeroy pleaded
OL,21,Fguilty to causing death by dangerous
OL,22,Fdriving.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,416,410,260,120,0,100
